# external-skills.manifest — machine-readable package list for install-external-skills.sh
# Format (one package per logical block):
#   PACKAGE <owner/repo>
#   SKILL <name>
#   SKILL <name>
# Blank line separates packages. Lines starting with # are comments.
# Do not store skill body text in ma-hub — only sources. See external-skills.md.
#
# Keep only what Grok 4.6 does not already do: tools, live library rules, or a
# unique MA ritual. Process/taste/second-OS packs stay out.
# Exception: emilkowalski/skills — animation/library expertise for /MA-design-screen,
# not a generic taste OS (impeccable / ui-ux-pro-max still banned).

PACKAGE dietrichgebert/ponytail
SKILL ponytail
SKILL ponytail-review

PACKAGE shadcn/ui
SKILL shadcn

PACKAGE vercel-labs/agent-skills
SKILL vercel-react-best-practices

PACKAGE supabase/agent-skills
SKILL supabase-postgres-best-practices

